# BAWAAL Arena Challenge Architecture (LOCKED baseline)

High-performance stealth-black sports network centered on **asynchronous 1v1 video battles**.
Further work builds on this contract — do not regress the dual feed, taxonomy scroller, 1-tap challenge camera, or post-record teardown.

## Core mechanics

- Side-by-side battle cards: **YOU / opener on the left** vs **challenger on the right** (`ArenaFeed.js` `BattleCard`).
- Open challenges: left = host benchmark (`@YOU`), right = empty RESPOND slot until athletes reply.
- Primary surface: `ArenaFeed.js` (Arena tab). Camera: `UniversalCamera.tsx`.

## Dual-segment Arena feed (`ArenaFeed.js`)

- Top toggle: **`ALL FEEDS` | `OPEN CHALLENGES`**.
- **Cold-start default: `ALL_FEEDS`** (Sparks, reels, high-engagement + battles).
- **`OPEN CHALLENGES`**: isolate active open callouts (`battle_thread` / open-challenge cards with target + RESPOND) — no Sparks/reel clutter.

